OL,3,GNEWSASNP councillor reinstated after
OL,4,Aprobe into Jordan Linden complaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of North Lanarkshire
OL,7,FCouncil's SNP group has been readmitted
OL,8,Fto the party, after a probe into her
OL,9,Fhandling of complaints about former
OL,10,Fcouncil leader Jordan Linden.
OL,12,FTracy Carragher had been accused of
OL,13,Fignoring or downplaying complaints
OL,14,Fabout Linden, who in May was jailed for
OL,15,Fsexually assaulting young men.
OL,17,FShe was suspended by the SNP and
OL,18,Fdropped as a regional list candidate
OL,19,Ffor Central Scotland and Lothians West
OL,20,Fin the Holyrood election.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
